		height: 150px;
		margin: -75px 0 0 -75px;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%, rgba(160, 245, 255, 0.75), rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.4) 40%, rgba(157, 123, 255, 0.3) 70%, transparent 100%);
